WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.698
Roxy's friends came out of the cafeteria.

2
00:00:03.699 --> 00:00:09.606
"I must get to Metro City Electronics," Roxy thought.

3
00:00:09.607 --> 00:00:13.094
"I'm going to the nurse," she said to her friends.

4
00:00:13.095 --> 00:00:15.793
"I, um, don't feel well.

5
00:00:15.794 --> 00:00:17.832
Maybe it was the tacos!"

6
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.459
Roxy hurried down the hall.

7
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.872
"Gee," Mara said. "I hope Roxy is okay."

8
00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:31.057
"She's probably fine," Terrell said.

9
00:00:31.058 --> 00:00:34.815
*** Roxy spotted Detective Smith in front of Metro City

10
00:00:34.816 --> 00:00:36.795
Electronics. She also saw

11
00:00:36.796 --> 00:00:39.958
trash. It was all over the sidewalk and

12
00:00:39.959 --> 00:00:46.539
street. Roxy landed. "Detective, you shouldn't

13
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.940
litter!" Detective Smith

14
00:00:48.941 --> 00:00:51.106
frowned. "Very funny, Rocket

15
00:00:51.107 --> 00:00:53.035
Girl. The trash hasn't been picked up this

16
00:00:53.036 --> 00:00:55.633
week. It's piling up

17
00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:58.331
everywhere." "Why?" Roxy

18
00:00:58.332 --> 00:01:00.405
asked. Detective Smith

19
00:01:00.406 --> 00:01:02.990
shrugged. "The Smart Brothers stopped answering their

20
00:01:02.991 --> 00:01:06.060
phones. So Mayor Bloom hired a new company to pick up the

21
00:01:06.061 --> 00:01:09.388
trash. I guess the new company forgot some

22
00:01:09.389 --> 00:01:12.985
streets." Just then a garbage truck zoomed

23
00:01:12.986 --> 00:01:16.519
by. Trashman's Trash Pickup was written on the

24
00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.518
side. "That's the new company," Detective Smith

25
00:01:19.519 --> 00:01:23.067
said. "I'm sure they'll pick up the garbage

26
00:01:23.068 --> 00:01:27.402
soon." Roxy and Detective Smith went into Metro City

27
00:01:27.403 --> 00:01:29.447
Electronics. An employee hurried

28
00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:35.035
over. "I'm glad you're here. Someone stole a bunch of things from our

29
00:01:35.036 --> 00:01:41.617
warehouse." She led Roxy and the detective past shelves filled with TVs, speakers, and other electronics.

30
00:01:41.618 --> 00:01:45.245
They went through some doors and entered a big warehouse.

31
00:01:45.246 --> 00:01:48.492
Roxy noticed that many shelves were empty.

32
00:01:48.493 --> 00:01:51.401
"The robber broke in through those doors."

33
00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:55.473
The employee pointed to a set of broken doors in the back of the warehouse.

34
00:01:55.474 --> 00:01:57.262
The doors led to an alley.

35
00:01:57.263 --> 00:01:59.251
Trash filled the alley.

36
00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:03.448
A dumpster overflowed with bags, rotting food, and other garbage.

37
00:02:03.449 --> 00:02:06.313
Detective Smith groaned.

38
00:02:06.314 --> 00:02:11.146
"I hope Trashman's Trash Pickup starts picking up garbage soon!"

39
00:02:11.147 --> 00:02:14.268
Roxy nodded. "I hope so too, Detective.

40
00:02:14.269 --> 00:02:16.752
But right now we need to solve this robbery."

41
00:02:16.753 --> 00:02:18.920
She turned to the employee.

42
00:02:18.921 --> 00:02:21.514
"Did you see the robbers?"

43
00:02:21.515 --> 00:02:23.410
The employee shook her head.

44
00:02:23.411 --> 00:02:25.211
"I was helping a customer.

45
00:02:25.212 --> 00:02:28.053
Then I came back here to look for a TV for him.

46
00:02:28.054 --> 00:02:31.268
I saw the broken doors and empty shelves."

47
00:02:31.269 --> 00:02:35.244
Vroom! A big truck rumbled down the alley.

48
00:02:35.245 --> 00:02:38.685
Wrappers and scraps of newspaper fluttered through the air.

49
00:02:38.686 --> 00:02:40.811
Detective Smith groaned again.

50
00:02:40.812 --> 00:02:42.881
"That was the garbage truck!

51
00:02:42.882 --> 00:02:46.672
Why didn't they stop here and pick up this trash?"

52
00:02:46.673 --> 00:02:50.359
Roxy watched the truck disappear around a corner.

53
00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.476
"I don't know, Detective.

54
00:02:52.477 --> 00:02:56.025
But I'm starting to think it's suspicious."

55
00:02:56.026 --> 00:02:58.201
Just then they heard a voice.

56
00:02:58.202 --> 00:03:02.426
"Someone stole my car!"

